1 'ASTRAL RIFT'~
LEGENDARY SPELL:

The astral plane generously comes to the aid of those who seek out, learn, and
apply this legendary spell. With the casting of this spell, a blast of pure
energy slices through time and space to damage your opponent with horrifying
results. With the power brought forth, it is no wonder that this spell is
legendary throughout this realm.

This high powered spell costs mana. See also Legendary
~
1 CONCENTRATE~
LEGENDARY SKILL:

Learning how to concentrate during battle is one of the most difficult tasks
to accomplish, but when you're taught by the master's and mistresses that have
sound advice, the ability to concentrate is very possible. Taught only to
those who seek this skill, the amount of hit and damage you do is increased.

This skill costs mana. See also: Legendary
~
1 WINDWALK~
LEGENDARY SKILL:

Dancing on the winds of change is never easy, but if you've mastered WINDWALK,
it's...a breeze. Using the currents of air all around you, parry, dodge, and
the ability to avoid being hit are increased. Just a puff of time goes by
before you must beckon the winds once more, but the affects are worth the time
invested in this skill.

This skill costs mana. See also: Legendary
~
1 BLADESONG~
LEGENDARY SKILL:

The power of a weapon that belongs to a person is increased simply by the
knowledge of the weapon itself. Legend has it, that if a certain skill is
learned, hitting your opponent is as easy as slicing butter with a hot knife.
The unity with one's blade is temporary and expensive to work but finding the
BLADESONG is a feeling only a selct few can master.

The cost of this skill costs hitpoints and moves. See also: Legendary
~
1 BLOODSONG~
LEGENDARY SKILL:

The heat of battle. The rage of your ancestors flowing through your veins. The
sounds of battle all around you but the only thing you can hear is the  sound
of your heart beating in your ears.  Your eyes lose focus as your muscles take
over with the memory of every trained skill you've ever honed to perfection.
You can only feel the flush of wrath as it overcomes you  with its BLOODSONG.

This skill costs hitpoints and moves.  See also: Legendary
~
1 STARCLOAK~
LEGENDARY SKILL:

Learning to become one with the heavens benefits the user of this skill by
protecting them in a cloak of stars that reflect negativity from the wearer.
Resistance is futile? Not a chance when this skill is applied.

This skill uses mana and moves. See also: Legendary
~
1 WILLPOWER~
LEGENDARY SKILL:

Better than a Baywatch lifeguard, this saves you all around for only the cost
of mana. See also: Legendary
~
65 FCHARMIE~
Syntax: fcharmie <master> <charmie> <duration>

This will set <charmie> as <master>'s charmie as if they cast the spell. The
spell will last for <duration> rounds. None of the parameters are optional.
~
1 ENCHANT TREASURE 'ENCHANT TREASURE'~
Syntax: cast 'enchant treasure' <item>

Items of type 'treasure' or 'arttreasure' may be enchanted with this spell,
yielding an addition to hit points and svd. This spell can enchant magical
as well as non-magical items but may not be used to enchant an item that is
already enchanted.
~
65 RECONOMY~
Syntax: reconomy

This will reset all area economies that are above 250,000,000 back to the
starting value of 250,000,000. This is to be used only in extreme cases where
several reboots, hotboots and/or crashes have caused a major increase in
economy values due to interest being calculated upon startup.
~
1 STOKE~
Syntax: stoke <combustable>

This command allows a player to add more combustables to a fire to increase
the fire's temperature. The fire has a maximum temperature of 6000 degrees.
~
1 GATHER~
Syntax: gather
        gather <type>

Gather allows a player to go into forested areas and gather up some wood. When
the player has reached 100% in the skill, they are able to gather specific
types of wood. Keep in mind that it is possible to run out of wood in a given
forested room.
~
1 IGNITE~
Syntax: ignite <combustable>

This skills allows a player to set a combustable on fire. Fires are used for
a variety of other skills. Different combustables will start the fire at
different temperatures.
~
1 DRY~
Syntax: dry <skin>

Drying a skin will make it into a hide that can then be used to craft certain
types of equipment or other items.
~
1 MINE~
Syntax: mine
        mine <type>

This skill allows a player to venture into mountainous or underground areas
and dig up various metals and gems. These items will need to be processed in
order to use them in any way. Once the player has reached 100% in this skill
they can then specify the type of item they want to mine for.
~
1 'QUEST EQUIPMENT' 'QUEST EQ' QUESTEQ~
Quest equipment is special equipment that can be bought using glory points.
These items have a special flag that allows only one owner to use them and
no one else. When a player dies, these items are transported back to the
player.
~
55 SETRANDOM~
Syntax: setrandom <object>

This command is used to mark an item as random so that it can be fstored in
a following pit or donated to the donation pit. It is to be used sparingly.
The item being marked as random must be in your inventory.

Idealy this is to be used only for clan chests that do not have the random
flag already on them.
~
