1 'PERSONAL LOCKERS' 'PERSONAL LOCKER'~
Syntax: locker buy
        locker open
        locker get <item>
        locker put <item>
        locker check

A personal locker is a special locker you can purchase with 5000 glory points.
You can take this locker with you anywhere. This locker has a capacity of
100kg when you first purchase it. You can increase its capacity up to 1000kg
by purchasing additional storage space, 100kg at a time. This locker is with
you always, unless taken from you by an immortal. It will allow you to store
any items you want inside it and access them from anywhere. There are some
restrictions to this. You will not be able to get or put any items in your
locker while you are in combat or shortly after combat with another player.

Locker commands -
locker buy: Spend 5000 glory to obtain a new 100kg personal locker or increase
  your existing locker by 100kg.
locker open: Used to check your locker's contents.
locker get <item>: Used to get an item from your locker.
locker put <item>: Used to put an item inside your locker.
locker check: This will tell you how much weight your locker contains and what
  its maximum capacity is.
~
